defect c7-III-02L7-folded-matrices D09 maps:src:D.2.31 Replace the uncredited historical certificate claim by the four displayed integral folds I^t Q_K R_0, their W kernels and nonzero leading minors. The new post-exposure program verifies all 80 additive occurrences.
