defect c7-III-02L7-integral-global-maps D22 maps:src:D.2.31 Give the primitive cap-elimination inverse, complete finite/regular/norm matrix, integral bounding-chain bridge section and dual torsion coordinates, including zero rational Euler number.
defect c7-III-02L7-physical-fan-step D25 maps:src:D.2.31 The allowed simply connected OS47 default I2-zero row (a,b)=(7,1), with an order-one regular v=gamma, has C=[[2,1],[-7,-3]] and C^-1 delta=(-1,2). The first edge quotient is z to z^2, hence has mu2 isotropy. Replace the false initial physical-circle assertion by the complete global Farey-flip diffeomorphism and inverse, after proving s=0 and choosing balls away from every primitive component section. The theorem and D.OD3 remain proved and unchanged.
defect c7-III-02L7-direct-smooth-reconstruction D22 maps:src:D.2.31 Give the component-section-preserving quotient localization, global Euler gauge, oriented twist-conjugation map, linking realization and connected-sum neck maps. The post-exposure note checks the original applied surgery/base pair and zero stabilization contribution; the receiver uses a direct unstabilized diffeomorphism without an unverified general cancellation attribution.
defect c7-III-02L7-primary-locators D18 maps:src:D.2.31 Use the actual product-clutching result at T=I, base S3, fibre S2, together with exact previously read Barden and Ulmer-Urzua/Schuett-Shioda loci. No new primary-PDF or visual reading is claimed.
event publish:c7:III:02L7:targeted targeted proof check group=publish:c7:III:02L7 Complete pre-exposure derivation frozen 2026-11-24T23:41:19.206106+00:00 and fully root-reviewed before release. Derived same-germ original-cap/line/roof maps, primitive fibre sections and full fixed-sweep kernels; integral exterior on all 172 rows, every finite/regular order and free twist with norm maps, complete global bridge and dual groups. New raw-fixture program and all 729 output lines read. Reconstructed 228 patterns on 160 rows with 30 positive defects and proved the full b=1 oriented smooth classification, including even M, by actual s=0, global fan maps preserving component sections, quotient Euler/spin and framed reconstruction. Full primary/input and exposure scopes are recorded. Frozen fresh proof, program, output and data bytes are unchanged. Historical target algorithms/outputs remain unopened and uncredited. Shared evidence group supplies no extra independent-family count. No canonical/global mutation, build, full-PDF or rendered-page reading, unit closure or paper-gate credit; root admission pending.
event publish:c7:III:02L7:physical-fan-refuted refuted, with the refined statement's id group=publish:c7:III:02L7 Refutes only the intermediate claim in the proof of maps:src:D.2.31 that the defining physical scalar circle at the prescribed rank-two cusp is already semifree. OS47 default, I2 zero, (a,b)=(7,1), kappa=1 gives C=[[2,1],[-7,-3]], C^-1 delta=(-1,2); its e1-edge quotient is z to z^2 and has mu2 isotropy. An order-one regular v=gamma makes this member simply connected. The refined intermediate assertion retains id maps:src:D.2.31: the completed output has a proved oriented global Farey-flip diffeomorphism, with reverse-word inverse and preservation of every primitive component section, to a delta-edge model carrying the semifree action. Fresh parts 8--12 prove actual s=0, every null flip and the full oriented reconstruction. Theorem D.OD3 is proved and unchanged; this event is not a theorem refutation. D25 only; no D26/D27. Full primary/input and exposure scopes are recorded. Frozen fresh proof, program, output and data bytes are unchanged. Historical target algorithms/outputs remain unopened and uncredited. Shared evidence group supplies no extra independent-family count. No canonical/global mutation, build, full-PDF or rendered-page reading, unit closure or paper-gate credit; root admission pending.
event publish:c7:III:02L7:whole-original-used used and rechecked in this run group=publish:c7:III:02L7 After individual release, read the whole original statement and all 12 proof items; compared every clause and auxiliary. Read the complete receiver and focused final corrections. Post-exposure raw program/output verifies 396 zero-Chern occurrences (316 multiplicative plus 80 additive), all 46 nonzero-Chern area rows/gcds with integral Wang preimages, all folded ranks and initial angular isotropy. The proof-step D25 is recorded separately; theorem clauses D.OD1--D.OD3 remain proved. The applied surgery/base-pair and zero stabilization contribution are checked; receiver uses the explicit unstabilized framed map. Six label/target pairs and five equation tags survive two separate exact guards. Exact local replay, balanced structures and TSV roundtrip passed; post-exposure work receives used/rechecked scope only. Full primary/input and exposure scopes are recorded. Frozen fresh proof, program, output and data bytes are unchanged. Historical target algorithms/outputs remain unopened and uncredited. Shared evidence group supplies no extra independent-family count. No canonical/global mutation, build, full-PDF or rendered-page reading, unit closure or paper-gate credit; root admission pending.
